        <div class="feature"><span class="em">📱</span><h3>Responsive</h3><p>Mobile par bottom bar, desktop par top toolbar.</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><span class="em">🌓</span><h3>Dark / Light</h3><p>System preference follow karta hai.</p></div>
