      <div class="feature-grid" style="margin-top:40px">
        <div class="feature"><span class="em">🌐</span><h3>Chrome / Edge</h3><p>Pill-shaped URL bar, Google palette.</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><span class="em">🦊</span><h3>Firefox</h3><p>Compact tabs, orange-purple accents.</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><span class="em">🧭</span><h3>Safari</h3><p>Traffic lights, minimal toolbar, blue accent.</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><span class="em">📱</span><h3>Mobile</h3><p>Bottom navigation bar, larger touch targets.</p></div>
